{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2018-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1535760000, "end_date": 1536364799, "month_true_total": 1038, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:57:54 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "44622513", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992912027", "personaname": "internet feelings", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197992912027/", "num_games_owned": 25, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 62048, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 362, "last_played": 1708455133, "avatar": "d601aca1a351d522845b6f4d8d8b2d0fad22815b"}, "language": "english", "review": "A bit like Destiny 2.. But better imo.\n", "timestamp_created": 1536361508, "timestamp_updated": 1536361508, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44622348", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048308369", "personaname": "Muus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198048308369/", "num_games_owned": 106, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 25054, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16098, "last_played": 1577664240, "avatar": "8f7d01d3fdefe92193b32cb06881cde2f8aff8cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe's one of those games where you'll probably get bored quickly because of the farming, but gets so much better once you push through it. Any company that decides to create a F2P game NEEDS to look at this great example, as nearly everything you can find can be earned for free, including the currency (which you'll probably use a lot to buy stuff quicker but can be farmed efficiently with various methods). \n\nThe game itself can get a little slow at times, and doesn't come without bug, but is certainly one of the ost enjoyable games to play whenever you have spare time", "timestamp_created": 1536360679, "timestamp_updated": 1536360679, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501874804496765137", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44622341", "author": {"steamid": "76561198183401755", "personaname": "Camataru`xl", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/indianutalpaiute/", "num_games_owned": 104, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 1417, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1223, "last_played": 1550959489, "avatar": "22499ba886d7058c4430b1f1a931787e02502eab"}, "language": "english", "review": "best free to play game :)", "timestamp_created": 1536360657, "timestamp_updated": 1536360657, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44621296", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119445193", "personaname": "Doge Vandire", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MrG0PNIK/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 8768, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6704, "last_played": 1774938806, "avatar": "f24afc9d770be3287087b151ff3f2bd23e4622ec"}, "language": "english", "review": "slide - jump - slide - jump - repeat, being a space ninja is better than being a bootleg masterchief (yes that was dissing destiny)", "timestamp_created": 1536355320, "timestamp_updated": 1536355320, "voted_u